    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Bone Knight Dedication, Bonecraft Mastery</p><hr /><p>You channel the ravenous cold of the Karrnathi crypts into a single, devastating strike. Make a melee Strike with a bonecraft weapon. On a hit, the Strike deals its normal weapon damage plus 3d8 void damage. On a critical hit, the target is also drained 1 and enfeebled 1 until the end of its next turn as its vitality is sapped by bonecraft marrow.</p>"
